at time is wasted. Today I want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1162.8412919999973,"totalMs":1162.8493329999983,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1144.8994579999999,"totalMs":1144.9105829999971,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1136.9069999999992,"totalMs":1136.9222919999957,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1122.3672499999957,"totalMs":1122.3895419999972,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Cut — recording has stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_re