afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1242.226917,"totalMs":1242.2477500000023,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1303.0795409999992,"totalMs":1303.0950410000005,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1260.7352079999982,"totalMs":1260.7458750000005,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet while you film — recording is running.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1251.3155419999966,"totalMs":1251.3280840000007,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Cut — recording has stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"val